# The 3D board in the window on full-chip Life: its LEDs as the GPU drew them
# against what the design drove, at each rate; btn[1] pressed through the
# board (it loads the pattern again); the views turned.
0    rate 4
1    run
16   rate 100
31   rate max
46   button 1 down
47   button 1 up
52   board top
62   board bottom
67   board 3d
72   rate real
87   pause
88   quit
